      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PERFECT PICTURE (2) was beaten into fourth last time but ran impressive time with a good 30.02 at The Meadows over 525m. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. MOMENT (3) flew the lids off the inside draw with a fast early split and gave a sight, finishing a 2.75 lengths third (34.64) over 595m at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Must be included in calculations. GORRINGE (8) turned in a better effort at The Meadows last start, finishing third behind Socialism (34.95) in a Grade 5. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from six attempts. Leading chance. TO PERU (1) can find the frame without surprising.",
